# The Amazin' Scorpio (windurst 61): Soni-Muni (Windurst Woods; she patrols a two-yalm path, so each trade follows a
# trigger; no default; Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst) answers her first while it is accepted, never here: #wildcat) and
# Gottah Maporushanoh (no default; Lost Chick answers his events' updates: hiddenQuests.lost_chick#windurst_owners).
# Their standards 421 / 420 are their scripts'. Fame 49 (level 1): Gottah 420, Soni-Muni 421; the stinger traded:
# nothing (not accepted). Fame 50 (level 2): 481 (0, 0, 1017), option 0: begun. Accepted: 482, Gottah 483; a block of
# animal glue: nothing; the stinger: 484: fame 20, Great Grappler Scorpio, 1500 gil, completed, the stinger taken.
# Completed: 485, Gottah 486; the second stinger: nothing (not accepted).
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-17.0,1.75,-58.0 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 49
item ScorpionStinger x2
item BlockOfAnimalGlue
login
trigger Gottah_Maporushanoh             # available: his 420
finish
trigger Soni-Muni                       # fame level 1: her 421
finish
trade Soni-Muni ScorpionStinger x1      # available: nothing
fame Windurst 50
trigger Soni-Muni                       # level 2: 481 (0, 0, 1017)
finish option=0                         # begun (any option)
trigger Soni-Muni                       # accepted: 482 (0, 0, 1017)
finish
trigger Gottah_Maporushanoh             # accepted: 483
finish
trigger Soni-Muni                       # 482 (beside her)
finish
trade Soni-Muni BlockOfAnimalGlue x1    # no stinger: nothing
trade Soni-Muni ScorpionStinger x1      # 484
finish                                  # fame 20; Great Grappler Scorpio; 1500 gil; completed; the stinger taken
trigger Soni-Muni                       # completed: 485
finish
trade Soni-Muni ScorpionStinger x1      # completed: nothing
trigger Gottah_Maporushanoh             # completed: 486
finish
